Package: miHelper
Title: Helper Functions to Combine Multiparameter Multiple Imputation Estimates
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Ivan Jacob Agaloos",
           family = "Pesigan",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "r.jeksterslab@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4818-8420"))
Description: Helper functions to combine multiparameter multiple imputation estimates
    including a multivariate version of Rubin's rules (Rubin, 1987 <doi:10.1002/9780470316696>)
    and the adjustment proposed by Li, Raghunathan, and Rubin
    (1991 <doi:10.1080/01621459.1991.10475152>).
    Models are fitted on the imputed data sets
    from 'mice', 'Amelia', or the multivariate normal model
    (EM and data augmentation, Schafer, 1997 <doi:10.1201/9780367803025>,
    in C++), and the estimates are pooled.
URL: https://github.com/ijapesigan/miHelper, https://ijapesigan.github.io/miHelper/
